{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e28cf8c96819e983ef73817145e12f468f36e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16^{\\frac{15}{x}}=32^{\\frac43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"19\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583846b1a94e7214046afc4edb14039bf512ca1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^b)^c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"22\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/6817bff8460e24cbf2d3931900c56fe41336fadb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>After writing both sides of the equation in powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/7/c0708f19839214055757c968c26c316a69d327cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^4)^{\\frac{15}{x}}=(2^5)^{\\frac43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"24\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/0/170bd1dfe5c5d34d5ffb09a2b5c614ced5668bcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\frac{60}{x}}=2^{\\frac{20}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Because the bases are equal, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b33e715f6e8f1d1759e9f94b26270e84584757ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{x}=\\frac{20}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff5fe427caa19e4e6794a81cebf35733b33f3a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 \\times 3 = 20 \\times x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a8954044cce3cff5dbe0458022cda094a25d6e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20x = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/23534ef57fb8037dd07ee0bfd31cd21ae52a07c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{180}{20} = \\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~originally by Yuhao2012 and modified by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017161307\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2078/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.949      1 2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    5.949      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35915:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017161307 and revision id 279211. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}